  "body_text": "96 \r\n The best time to hold a steadier portfolio is before the weather turns. Dear Investor, \n\n &nbsp;\n\n September is the market's weakest month and has been since 1928 , averaging −1.1%. This year it meets an uncertain Fed, high Treasury yields, and the 2026 midterms. * \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n When months like this hit, a portfolio riding a few big names can hand back a year of gains in weeks. The goal isn't to hide in cash; it's to keep growing, with less of the drop. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n That's Quant Growth & Income (QG&I) : up to 30 screened companies, steady dividends cushioning the swings, and a disciplined process that ignores the noise. Since June 3, it is up +8.89% against its benchmark VYM's −0.87%.** \r\n\n &nbsp;\n\n The model runs whether you're in it or not. Every week you wait, it makes its moves without you. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n You can't control the market this fall. You can choose to keep growing through it. \n\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n Subscribe to QG&amp;I \r\n — The Seeking Alpha Quant Team \n\n Scan to download the Seeking Alpha App:\n\n Download the Seeking Alpha App:\n\n \r\n \r\n \r\n *September seasonality and midterm-year pattern from The QG&I Dividend Letter: A Perfect Storm (Steven Cress, Seeking Alpha, 9/4/26; data from Charles Schwab, Bloomberg, and Citadel). \n\n &nbsp;\n\n **Quant Growth & Income and Vanguard High Dividend Yield ETF (VYM) performances are as of September 23, 2026.&nbsp; \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n Past performance is no guarantee of future results. Backtesting reflects historical relationships, not actual performance. QG&I is not an investment product run with real money and neither enables nor reflects actual trading activity. The above is offered for informational purposes only. Seeking Alpha does not take account of your objectives or financial situation and does not offer any personalized investment advice. Seeking Alpha is not a licensed securities dealer, broker, U.S. investment adviser, or investment bank. See more. \r\n\n Sent by Seeking Alpha, 244 5th Ave, Suite 2705, New York, NY 10001 \n\n Why are you receiving this? You subscribed to Seeking Alpha Marketing Updates.&nbsp; \n\n \r\n Unsubscribe from this list | Update your email preferences \n\n \r\n https://email-st.seekingalpha.com/oc/60ef41e776faba580a6caca0sd2to.8gcb/701a4325",
